[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0027","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11629","title":"dayrui FineCMS 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"dayrui FineCMS 5.0.10 及之前版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 controllers/api.php 文件中。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 c=api&m=data2 请求，在 function 参数中注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击者无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接或访问特定页面）。该漏洞影响 FineCMS 5.0.10 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11629"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-26T08:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:06Z","remediation":"升级 FineCMS 至 5.0.9 及以上版本（如 5.0.9 已修复该漏洞）；若无法升级，手动编辑 dayrui/controllers/api.php 中 data2 函数，对 $function 参数使用 htmlspecialchars() 或 strip_tags() 过滤后输出；建议迁移至仍在维护的 CMS 系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lorexxar.cn/2017/07/20/FineCMS%20multi%20vulnerablity%20before%20v5.0.9/#api-php-Reflected-XSS","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11629.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11629.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11629.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11629.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-11629/vultarget/docker-compose.yml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-11629_2.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2017-11629.json","https://github.com/wpsec/ARL-Source-Install/blob/aecf83f1f55a6f1a1a67dbe25e22ea0eb5a44bf2/tools/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11629.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-11629_1.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/CVE-2017-11629.yaml","https://github.com/ontomorlite1972/https-github.com-github-advisory-database/blob/8b1e9fbfe280d292949dba8ca22a6602e56464df/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8p8j-v2pp-gv68/GHSA-8p8j-v2pp-gv68.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0025","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11586","title":"dayrui FineCMS 开放重定向漏洞","description":"FineCms 5.0.9 版本中存在 URL 重定向漏洞，位于 controllers/Weixin.php 文件的 sync 动作中，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 url 参数将用户重定向至任意外部网站。该漏洞属于开放重定向（CWE-601），攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接）。成功利用可导致钓鱼攻击、诱导用户访问恶意站点，造成信息泄露或进一步的社会工程攻击。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11586"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-24T00:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:03Z","remediation":"升级 FineCms 至 5.0.9 以上版本（如已停止维护则迁移至其他 CMS）。如无法升级，修改 controllers/Weixin.php 中 sync 操作的 url 参数处理逻辑，添加白名单校验，仅允许跳转到可信域名，并禁止未经验证的外部 URL 重定向。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lorexxar.cn/2017/07/20/FineCMS%20multi%20vulnerablity%20before%20v5.0.9/#URL-Redirector-Abuse","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11586.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11586.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11586.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11586.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-11586.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-11586/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-11586.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-11586_2.yaml","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--976ac9cb-3984-41b0-b936-82a240fed18b.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-11586_4.yaml","https://github.com/just3019/CNVD-updater/blob/9dc9a399fbccf390b766c915659e58871204e4df/cnvd/2017-07-31_2017-08-06.xml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/e10d60d68d9699b78a04c3d543f551d2d1328421/api/2017/CVE-2017-11586.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1308","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9822","title":"DNN DotNetNuke 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"DotNetNuke (DNN) 内容管理系统在处理 Cookie 数据时存在代码注入漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的 Cookie 负载向服务器注入恶意代码。由于攻击者无需身份验证且无需用户交互即可触发漏洞，导致攻击者在受影响的 DNN 网站上拥有了远程代码执行权限。该漏洞影响版本早于 9.1.1 的所有 DNN 系统，攻击者可利用此漏洞获取目标服务器控制权、窃取敏感数据或进一步横向移动到内部网络。该漏洞因其严重性而被评为 \"2017-08 (Critical) Possible remote code execution on DNN sites.\"，CVSS 评分高达 8.8，威胁等级为 HIGH。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9822"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-20T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:28:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 DotNetNuke (DNN) 至 9.1.1 或更高版本（官方安全更新已修复该 Cookie 反序列化 RCE 漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在 WAF 层面拦截包含恶意序列化载荷的 Cookie 请求，并限制管理后台仅允许受信 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157080/DotNetNuke-Cookie-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community/security/security-center","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102213","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-9822","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9822.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9822.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/467e8414b7cae9064886839b1c4a1f4c155804ed/2017/CVE-2017-9822.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ae7cbf60471587bdea4445c1578df6c016019acf/2017/CVE-2017-9822.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-9822.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-9822/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-9822.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9822.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/by-cve/CVE-2017-9822.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e2167826924a909ba74aa4b927b955e7dace62c3/2017/CVE-2017-9822.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2017/CVE-2017-9822-Tnot123_cve-2017-9822.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2017-9822.yaml","https://github.com/murataydemir/CVE-2017-9822","https://github.com/tranphuc2005/CVE-2017-9822","https://github.com/Tnot123/cve-2017-9822"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1308.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-1308.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0806","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6316","title":"Citrix NetScaler SD-WAN 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix NetScaler SD-WAN 设备（含 CloudBridge 系列）v9.1.2.26.561201 及之前版本存在命令注入漏洞。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 CGISESSID（CloudBridge 设备为 CAKEPHP）Session ID Cookie，利用输入验证缺陷以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响范围广泛。目前已存在公开的 Metasploit 利用模块，攻击者可直接获取设备完全控制权。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6316"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-20T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 Citrix NetScaler SD-WAN 至 10.0.0 或更高版本（CloudBridge 设备同步升级），该漏洞已在 CTX220265 公告中修复。如无法立即升级，可在管理接口前端部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF），配置规则拦截包含异常 CGISESSID 或 CAKEPHP cookie 值的请求，并限制管理接口仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99943","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039019","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX225990","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42345/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42346/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6316","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42345","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6316.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6316.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6316","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-6316.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/16901ed3086419e92a3d59446e25736507cf6a0b/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6316.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6316/README.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/28158.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6316.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6316.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9f8x-323m-6vw4/GHSA-9f8x-323m-6vw4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0023","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11444","title":"Intelliants Subrion CMS SQL注入漏洞","description":"Subrion CMS 4.1.5.9 及之前版本的前端搜索功能（/front/search.php）存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者通过 $_GET 数组传入特制参数即可触发，无需身份认证。成功利用可导致攻击者远程获取数据库敏感信息、篡改数据甚至获取服务器控制权。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方已在 4.1.5.10 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11444"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-19T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Subrion CMS 至 4.1.5.10 或更高版本；若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙配置 SQL 注入防护规则拦截 /front/search.php 的恶意 $_GET 参数，或在 PHP 配置中启用预处理语句防护作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/intelliants/subrion/issues/479","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11444.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11444.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11444.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-11444-2869.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11444.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-11444.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-11444-2865.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2017-11444-2866_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-11444-2868.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11444"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1008","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6744","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE SNMP远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 SNMP 子系统中存在远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2017-6744）。该漏洞源于 SNMP 子系统在处理特制 SNMP 请求时存在缓冲区溢出缺陷，经过身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备的 SNMP 服务发送精心构造的数据包触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以设备权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 12.0 至 15.6 及 IOS XE 多个版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者需拥有有效的 SNMP 读写社区字符串（community string）方可利用，但社区字符串可通过暴力破解或嗅探获取。Cisco 已发布安全公告 cisco-sa-20170629-snmp 提供修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6744"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2017-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至不受影响版本（通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker 查询对应版本的第一修复版本），或升级 IOS XE 至 3.18 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：在全局配置下使用 snmp-server view NO_BAD_SNMP 排除 ADSL-LINE-MIB、CISCO-SLB-EXT-MIB 等 10 个受影响 MIB，并将该视图绑定到 SNMP community 字符串；同时限制 SNMP 仅允许可信管理站访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6744.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6744.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6744","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6744/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6744.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6744.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6744.csv","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/126839.txt","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2017-6744.md","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1006","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6743","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE SNMP远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 SNMP 子系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 SNMP 数据包（支持 IPv4 和 IPv6）触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行或设备重载。该漏洞影响所有启用 SNMP 且未排除受影响 MIB 或 OID 的设备，涉及 SNMP v1、v2c 和 v3 版本。利用 SNMP v2c 及更早版本需知道只读 community 字符串，利用 SNMP v3 需拥有用户凭据。成功利用可获取设备完全控制权。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6743"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:56Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 至 Cisco Security Advisory cisco-sa-20170629-snmp 中对应版本（使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 查询具体修复版本）。临时缓解措施：在全局配置模式下创建 SNMP 视图排除受影响 MIB，执行 `snmp-server view NO_BAD_SNMP iso included` 及后续排除命令禁用 ADSL-LINE-MIB、ALPS-MIB、CISCO-ADSL-DMT-LINE-MIB 等 10 个 MIB，并将该视图绑定到 SNMP community 字符串。同时限制仅允许可信源 IP 访问 SNMP 服务，定期更换 SNMP community 字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6743","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6743.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6743.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6743","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6743/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6743.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6743.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6743.csv","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/e160f44079f8107bd6d64587e6bc849137b6957a/CVEs/2017/CVE-2017-6743.md","https://github.com/UWillC/netdevops-micro-tools/blob/f48ba521c0ebeecb2d2781b20e11cf059f66107c/cve_data/ios_xe/cve-2017-6743.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1000","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6742","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE SNMP远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 的 SNMP 实现存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119），由于受影响代码区域对 SNMP 数据包处理不当导致。经过身份验证的远程攻击者通过向目标设备发送特制的 SNMP 数据包，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致设备重载或远程代码执行，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 SNMP v1、v2c 和 v3 所有版本，攻击者需知道 SNMP 只读团体字符串（v2c 及更早版本）或用户凭据（SNMPv3）。仅定向发送到受影响系统的流量可用于利用此漏洞。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6742"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:56Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 至 Cisco Security Advisory cisco-sa-20170629-snmp 中对应版本的第一修复版本（使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具查询具体版本号）。如无法立即升级，可通过全局配置模式执行 snmp-server view NO_BAD_SNMP iso included 创建视图，逐一排除 ADSL-LINE-MIB、CISCO-AUTH-FRAMEWORK-MIB、CISCO-SLB-EXT-MIB 等受影响 MIB，并将该视图绑定到 SNMP 只读 community 字符串；同时限制仅允许可信管理站 IP 访问 SNMP 服务，定期更换 SNMP community 字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6742","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6742.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-6742.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6742","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/34c140d2b813dc095e2cd5ddc5f4caa934ff1f07/2017/CVE-2017-6742.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6742/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6742.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6742.csv","https://github.com/jacobdjwilson/awesome-annual-security-reports/blob/e0a9745ed2673285339a42dbc0f66e018e976b5c/Markdown%20Conversions/2023/Cyble-Annual-Threat-Landscape-2023.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-cw5p-gwrw-rv56/GHSA-cw5p-gwrw-rv56.json","https://github.com/PurpleAILAB/Decepticon/blob/e34afba0db5879501113578d1013026686fa5482/packages/decepticon/decepticon/skills/shared/adversary-emulation/apt28-fancy-bear/SKILL.md","https://github.com/sastraadiwiguna-purpleeliteteaming/Cisco-IOS-Exploitation-JAGUAR_TOOTH-CVE-2017-6742-Reconstruction"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0999","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6740","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE SNMP 子系统缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 SNMP 子系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于 SNMP 协议处理组件对特制 SNMP 数据包的长度校验不足，导致内存破坏。远程认证攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 SNMPv1/SNMPv2c/SNMPv3 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行或设备重载，从而完全控制受影响系统。攻击者若使用 SNMPv2c 及更早版本需知道只读团体字符串，使用 SNMPv3 需拥有用户凭据。该漏洞影响所有启用了 SNMP 且未排除受影响 MIB 或 OID 的 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 设备，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6740"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Cisco 官方修复版本，通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/iosChecker）查询对应版本并升级至 First Fixed 版本。如无法立即升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 snmp-server view NO_BAD_SNMP iso included 创建视图，逐一排除受影响 MIB（ADSL-LINE-MIB、ALPS-MIB、CISCO-BSTUN-MIB 等 10 个 MIB），然后通过 snmp-server community mycomm view NO_BAD_SNMP RO 将视图绑定到 SNMP community 字符串，限制对受影响 MIB 的访问。同时限制 SNMP 访问仅允许可信管理站 IP，并使用 ACL 过滤 SNMP 流量（UDP 161/162）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6740","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6740.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6740.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6740","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6740.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6740/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6740.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6740.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-6740.md","https://github.com/UWillC/netdevops-micro-tools/blob/f48ba521c0ebeecb2d2781b20e11cf059f66107c/cve_data/ios_xe/cve-2017-6740.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0909","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6739","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE SNMP远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 的 SNMP 协议实现存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。该漏洞源于受影响代码区域在处理特制 SNMP 数据包时未正确验证边界，导致缓冲区溢出。经过身份认证的远程攻击者通过向目标设备发送特制的 SNMP 数据包，可触发该漏洞，导致目标系统重载或远程执行任意代码，从而完全控制设备。攻击者需知晓 SNMP 只读团体字符串（SNMPv2c 及更早版本）或用户凭据（SNMPv3）。该漏洞影响所有 SNMP 版本（1、2c 和 3），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6739"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:55Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Cisco IOS Software Checker 中对应版本的最新修复版本（访问 https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x 查询具体修复版本号）。如无法立即升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 snmp-server view 命令禁用受影响 MIB（包括 ADSL-LINE-MIB、ALPS-MIB、CISCO-AUTH-FRAMEWORK-MIB 等 10 个 MIB），并限制仅允许可信管理站访问 SNMP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6739","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6739.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6739.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6739","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6739.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6739/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6739.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6739.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-6739.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be74