udapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6737","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6737.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6737.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6737","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6737/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6737.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6737.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-6737.csv","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/e160f44079f8107bd6d64587e6bc849137b6957a/CVEs/2017/CVE-2017-6737.md","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/e0e47928c2afb212abbd2ecf4e3c1a9710ad8b16/packages/sca/data/calibration/kev_signals.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f29v-pr27-8f5j/GHSA-f29v-pr27-8f5j.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0900","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6736","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE SNMP缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 SNMP（简单网络管理协议）子系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于 SNMP 协议处理过程中对输入数据长度校验不足，当处理特制的 SNMP 数据包时触发栈缓冲区溢出。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 IPv4 或 IPv6 向目标系统发送精心构造的 SNMP 报文来利用此漏洞。利用 SNMP v1/v2c 时攻击者需知道只读团体字符串（community string），利用 SNMP v3 时需拥有有效用户凭据。成功利用可导致远程代码执行，使攻击者完全控制受影响设备，或导致设备重载。该漏洞影响所有启用了 SNMP 且未排除受影响 MIB 或 OID 的 Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 设备，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6736"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:22:53Z","remediation":"升级到 Cisco 官方公告中对应版本的第一修复版本（使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 查询具体版本号）。临时缓解措施：在设备上通过 snmp-server view 命令禁用受影响 MIB（ADSL-LINE-MIB、ALPS-MIB、CISCO-SLB-EXT-MIB 等 10 个 MIB），并限制 SNMP 只允许可信管理站访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99345","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038808","https://github.com/artkond/cisco-snmp-rce","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170629-snmp","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43450/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43450","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6736.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-6736.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6736","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6736/README_KO.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/204%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6736.txt","https://github.com/ffffffff0x/1earn/blob/4b34dd1f150b45a82b8830aa1e737ba370f8c015/1earn/Security/IOT/%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/Device-Exploits.md","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-6736/README.md","https://github.com/CaledoniaProject/awesome-opensource-security/blob/9624c51ae6eade44fff9d63a5b26cecca9681298/Hardware-Security/Router-Tools.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2017/CVE-2017-6736.json","https://github.com/msztankowski/CiscoIOSSNMPToolkit","https://github.com/plyrthn/CiscoIOSSNMPToolkit","https://github.com/plyrthn/CiscoSpectreTakeover"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0015","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000029","title":"Oracle GlassFish Server Open Source Edition 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Oracle GlassFish Server Open Source Edition 3.0.1 (build 22) 存在本地文件包含漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过特制请求读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需任何认证即可利用，攻击者可通过构造包含路径遍历的 URL 访问受限文件，如配置文件、密码文件等。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响 GlassFish Server 3.0.1 版本。建议用户升级至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000029"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-17T13:18:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:36Z","remediation":"升级到 Eclipse GlassFish 7.0.0 及以上版本（原 Oracle GlassFish 已移交 Eclipse 基金会），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 `file%3a///` 或 `file:///` 的请求路径，或删除 `resource` 目录下对文件协议的处理逻辑作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.trustwave.com/Resources/Security-Advisories/Advisories/TWSL2016-011/?fid=8037","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000029.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000029.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000029.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2017/1000xxx/CVE-2017-1000029.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2017-1000029","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2017-1000029-2835.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000029.poc","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-1000029.js","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/13/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/daffainfo/cvelist/blob/c592bc26e42385bbe23d81af4b922d0b289e8d31/cves/2017/1000xxx/CVE-2017-1000029.json","https://github.com/ahisec/Lots-of-POC/blob/51ed84ccc21e97e5e12563150992e03f9de384cd/goby/2022/CVD-2022-1284.go"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0014","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000028","title":"Oracle GlassFish Server 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Oracle GlassFish Server Open Source Edition 4.1 存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，在路径中插入 `../` 等目录遍历序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，且无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可通过构造类似 `http://target/theme/META-INF/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/%c0%ae%c0%ae/etc/passwd` 的请求实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 GlassFish Server Open Source Edition 4.1 版本，已有公开的 Metasploit 模块和 Nuclei 模板可用于检测。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000028"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-17T13:18:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:36Z","remediation":"建议立即将 GlassFish Server Open Source Edition 升级至 5.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续大版本中修复。如无法升级，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 使用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或入侵防御系统（IPS）拦截包含 `%c0%af`、`%c0%ae` 等目录遍历编码的请求；2) 将管理控制台（默认端口 4848/TCP）限制在可信网络内访问，避免暴露到公网；3) 禁用不必要的主题资源路径 `/theme/` 的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45196/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45198/","https://www.trustwave.com/Resources/Security-Advisories/Advisories/TWSL2015-016/?fid=6904","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45196","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000028.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000028.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/glassfish/CVE-2017-1000028/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-1000028.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000028.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-1000028-2831.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/glassfish-cve-2017-1000028-lfi.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/poc/glassfish-cve-2017-1000028-lfi.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2017-1000028","https://github.com/cqr-cryeye-forks/goby-pocs/blob/ffef890592ee0c35c94a148c9f7b96b8728036d4/GlassFish-Arbitrary-File-Read-(CVE-2017-1000028).json","https://github.com/chaitin/xray-plugins/blob/4ca4d599997e450822a03c976b8cbf28ffd9ddcd/poc/manual/glassfish-cve-2017-1000028-lfi.yml","https://github.com/NeonNOXX/CVE-2017-1000028"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0014.toml"}]